The research scorer adapts unsloth/embeddinggemma-2, based on Google's
EmbeddingGemma 2, and uses frozen unsloth/Qwen3.5-0.8B, based on Qwen's
Qwen3.5-0.8B. Their model cards declare Apache-2.0. Pretrained base weights
are fetched separately and are not included in this release.

Project changes comprise audio LoRA adaptation, speech and criterion scoring
heads, feature normalization, inference integration and checkpoint packaging.
This is an independent research project; no upstream or IELTS endorsement
or affiliation is claimed.

Training/evaluation sources include mispeech/speechocean762 and the
Amanafif554 IELTS audio/transcription datasets. Exact revisions are recorded
in training_data_sources.json in the model release. See THIRD_PARTY.md there
for the unresolved IELTS dataset permissions. No training recordings,
transcripts or rater feedback are included in the release.
